<title>USA: Jones Medical comfortable with $0.78 share estimate.</title>
<headline>Jones Medical comfortable with $0.78 share estimate.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO, California 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical company Jones Medical Industries Inc said Wednesday it was &quot;comfortable&quot; with industry analysts's consensus estimates of a $0.78-per-share net income for 1996, which is 56 percent higher than the previous year.  </p>
<p>The company said its registered sales for the year ended December 31 totalling $98 million, 75 percent more than 1995.</p>
<p>Net income for 1996 was $22 million, 77 percent higher than the previous year, the company said.</p>
